@startuml UC-07-QuanLyHocVien
!pragma layout smetana

title UC-07: Quản lý học viên (Thêm học viên)

actor        "Admin"                                       as Admin
boundary     "StudentManagementPage\n(React)"              as StudentPage
control      "StudentController\n(REST)"                   as StudentController
control      "StudentService"                              as StudentService
entity       "UserRepository"                              as UserRepo
entity       "StudentProfileRepository"                    as StudentProfileRepo
database     "MySQL"                                        as DB

== Main Success Scenario ==

Admin -> StudentPage: 1. Chọn "Thêm học viên"
StudentPage -> StudentPage: 2. Hiển thị form\n(họ tên, email, SĐT,\nngày sinh, địa chỉ)
Admin -> StudentPage: 3. Nhập thông tin học viên
Admin -> StudentPage: 4. Click "Lưu"
StudentPage -> StudentController: 5. POST /api/students\n{fullName, email, phone,\ndob, address}
activate StudentController

StudentController -> StudentService: 6. createStudent(data)
activate StudentService

StudentService -> UserRepo: 7. existsByEmail(email)
activate UserRepo
UserRepo -> DB: 8. SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users\nWHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> UserRepo: 9. count
deactivate DB
UserRepo --> StudentService: 10. boolean
deactivate UserRepo

alt 11. Email chưa tồn tại
  StudentService -> StudentService: 12. Validate email/phone format
  StudentService -> StudentService: 13. Generate default password
  StudentService -> UserRepo: 14. save(user)
  activate UserRepo
  UserRepo -> DB: 15. INSERT INTO users\n(name, email, password,\nphone, role, status)
  activate DB
  DB --> UserRepo: 16. User entity (with ID)
  deactivate DB
  UserRepo --> StudentService: 17. savedUser
  deactivate UserRepo

  StudentService -> StudentProfileRepo: 18. save(profile)
  activate StudentProfileRepo
  StudentProfileRepo -> DB: 19. INSERT INTO student_profiles\n(user_id, dob, address,\njoin_date)
  activate DB
  DB --> StudentProfileRepo: 20. Profile entity
  deactivate DB
  StudentProfileRepo --> StudentService: 21. savedProfile
  deactivate StudentProfileRepo

  StudentService -> StudentService: 22. Ghi Audit Log
  StudentService --> StudentController: 23. StudentDTO
  deactivate StudentService
  StudentController --> StudentPage: 24. 201 Created\n{student info}
  deactivate StudentController
  StudentPage -> StudentPage: 25. Refresh danh sách học viên
  StudentPage --> Admin: 26. Thông báo\n"Thêm học viên thành công"

else 11a. Email đã tồn tại
  StudentService --> StudentController: 27. Throw DuplicateEmailException
  deactivate StudentService
  StudentController --> StudentPage: 28. 409 Conflict\n"Email đã được sử dụng"
  deactivate StudentController
  StudentPage --> Admin: 29. Hiển thị thông báo lỗi
end

== Critical Exception: DB Error ==

Admin -> StudentPage: 30. Nhập thông tin và lưu
StudentPage -> StudentController: 31. POST /api/students
activate StudentController
StudentController -> StudentService: 32. createStudent(data)
activate StudentService
StudentService -> UserRepo: 33. existsByEmail(email)
activate UserRepo
UserRepo -> DB: 34. SELECT ...
activate DB
DB --> UserRepo: 35. SQL Exception
deactivate DB
UserRepo --> StudentService: 36. Throw DataAccessException
deactivate UserRepo
StudentService --> StudentController: 37. Throw SystemErrorException
deactivate StudentService
StudentController --> StudentPage: 38. 500 Internal Server Error
deactivate StudentController
StudentPage --> Admin: 39. "Hệ thống có lỗi,\nvui lòng thử lại"

@enduml
